{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "stages": [
    { "id": "basic", "name": "一 基础功能" },
    { "id": "cli", "name": "二 CLI 专门功能" },
    { "id": "app", "name": "三 App 功能" },
    { "id": "applications", "name": "四 App 内应用功能" },
    { "id": "cases", "name": "五 用户 case" }
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "stage": "cases",
      "node": "^(office-skill-pi|machine-learning-skill-pi|publish-artifact-pi|main-recovery-pi|application-bootstrap-pi|blender-bootstrap-pi|cad-agent-workflow|input-files-pi|vision-session|live-ui)\\.test\\.js$",
      "browser": "^(cad-chat|pptist-chat|human-interactions|message-delivery|conversation-integrity|request-recovery)\\.spec\\.js$"
    },
    {
      "stage": "cli",
      "node": "^(cli-onboarding|cli-commands|agent-smoke-cli|reasoning-launcher|main-run-env)\\.test\\.js$",
      "browser": "(?!)"
    },
    {
      "stage": "applications",
      "node": "^(application-|binding-|blender-|cad-|computer-|pptist-|text-document-session|software-boundaries|independent-instance-model|workspace-text)",
      "browser": "^(app-instances|binding-menu|blender|cad|collaboration-picker|computer-use|independent-applications|local-file-open|original-file|pptist|recovery-review|workbench|workspace-applications|workspace-projects)"
    },
    {
      "stage": "app",
      "node": "^(desktop-|composer-|conversation-view|artifact-ui|artifact-navigation|voice-input|markdown|workbench-dom|workbench-ui|tab-refresh|workbench-tab-identity|model-settings|app-boot|request-error)"
    }
  ],
  "nativeNode": ["test/computer-native.test.js"],
  "nativeBrowserPattern": "-desktop\\.spec\\.js$",
  "nativeVariants": [
    { "file": "e2e/model-profiles.spec.js", "kind": "browser", "pattern": "desktop: saved connections" },
    {
      "file": "test/desktop-dev.test.js",
      "kind": "node",
      "pattern": "Finder development entry|Mac launch gives",
      "enableEnv": "ATRIA_NATIVE_DESKTOP_TEST"
    },
    {
      "file": "test/desktop-update-install.test.js",
      "kind": "node",
      "pattern": "native disposable App update",
      "enableEnv": "ATRIA_MANAGED_UPDATE_NATIVE"
    }
  ],
  "anchors": [
    {
      "cases": [
        "INTERACT-02",
        "INTERACT-03",
        "INTERACT-05",
        "INTERACT-06",
        "INTERACT-08",
        "INTERACT-15",
        "APPHUMAN-15"
      ],
      "files": [
        "test/main-inbox-delivery.test.js",
        "e2e/message-delivery.spec.js",
        "test/conversation.test.js"
      ],
      "note": "已有补充/排队/晋升/取消及持久投递断言；新目录的全部竞态仍需逐项核对。"
    },
    {
      "cases": ["CLI-01", "CLI-02", "CLI-03", "CLI-04", "CLI-06", "CLI-07"],
      "files": ["test/cli-onboarding.test.js", "test/agent-smoke-cli.test.js"],
      "note": "已有命令/初始化回归；最终 tgz 的独立安装和真实 PTY 仍单列。"
    },
    {
      "cases": ["APPHUMAN-02", "APPHUMAN-05", "APPHUMAN-06", "COMPOSER-02", "COMPOSER-03"],
      "files": ["e2e/message-boundaries.spec.js", "e2e/message-delivery.spec.js"],
      "note": "已有草稿、队列和晚返回场景；不能据此声称丢响应或预期 Run 校验已完整覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "cases": ["APPCHAT-01", "APPCHAT-02", "APPCHAT-04", "APPCHAT-07", "APPCHAT-08"],
      "files": [
        "test/conversation-api.test.js",
        "test/conversation-view.test.js",
        "e2e/conversation-integrity.spec.js"
      ],
      "note": "已有轮次/历史断言，五轮完整任务与原生重启仍需按目录验收。"
    },
    {
      "cases": ["TXT-01", "TXT-02", "TXT-03", "TXT-04", "TXT-05"],
      "files": [
        "test/text-document-session.test.js",
        "test/application-text-adapter.test.js",
        "e2e/workbench.spec.js"
      ],
      "note": "已有文本资源/草稿与工作台测试；按应用手册核对具体子项。"
    },
    {
      "cases": ["CAD-01", "CAD-02", "CAD-03", "CAD-04", "CAD-05", "CAD-06"],
      "files": [
        "test/cad-program.test.js",
        "test/cad-native.test.js",
        "test/cad-assembly.test.js",
        "e2e/cad-program.spec.js",
        "e2e/cad-assembly.spec.js"
      ],
      "note": "真实引擎可因依赖不足跳过；固定 C1/C2 与最终包结果不能仅凭文件名标通过。"
    },
    {
      "cases": ["BLENDER-01", "BLENDER-02", "BLENDER-03", "BLENDER-04", "BLENDER-05", "BLENDER-06"],
      "files": [
        "test/blender-application.test.js",
        "test/blender-document-session.test.js",
        "test/blender-installer.test.js",
        "e2e/blender-install.spec.js"
      ],
      "note": "已有场景/快照/安装回归；首次联网安装及原生工程重开另验。"
    },
    {
      "cases": ["GUI-01", "GUI-02", "GUI-03", "GUI-04", "GUI-05", "GUI-06"],
      "files": [
        "test/computer-use.test.js",
        "test/computer-http.test.js",
        "test/computer-native.test.js",
        "e2e/computer-use.spec.js",
        "e2e/computer-global.spec.js",
        "e2e/computer-settings-desktop.spec.js"
      ],
      "note": "设置单开关全局允许观察和操作，按任务自动选窗；Electron 隔离驱动验证保存与重启，真实原生输入仍需要系统授权。"
    },
    {
      "cases": [
        "PPTIST-01",
        "PPTIST-02",
        "PPTIST-03",
        "PPTIST-04",
        "PPTIST-05",
        "PPTIST-06",
        "PPTIST-07",
        "PPTIST-08"
      ],
      "files": [
        "test/pptist-application.test.js",
        "test/pptist-document-session.test.js",
        "test/pptist-fidelity.test.js",
        "test/pptist-fullscreen.test.js",
        "e2e/pptist-save.spec.js",
        "e2e/pptist-fidelity.spec.js",
        "e2e/pptist-artifact.spec.js",
        "e2e/pptist-desktop.spec.js"
      ],
      "note": "已有真实编辑器与导出回归；布局、字体及最终包仍需人工查看。"
    },
    {
      "cases": ["APPINSTANCE-01", "APPINSTANCE-02", "APPINSTANCE-03", "APPINSTANCE-04"],
      "files": [
        "test/independent-instance-model.test.js",
        "e2e/app-instances.spec.js",
        "e2e/independent-applications.spec.js",
        "e2e/original-file-save.spec.js"
      ],
      "note": "独立实例/工作区/原文件使用生产路径；新清单仍标部分映射。"
    },
    {
      "cases": [
        "CASE-04",
        "CASE-05",
        "CASE-06",
        "CASE-07",
        "CASE-08",
        "CASE-09",
        "CASE-10",
        "CASE-11",
        "CASE-12",
        "CASE-13",
        "CASE-18",
        "CASE-20",
        "CASE-25"
      ],
      "files": [
        "test/main-recovery-pi.test.js",
        "test/publish-artifact-pi.test.js",
        "test/office-skill-pi.test.js",
        "e2e/message-delivery.spec.js",
        "e2e/pptist-chat.spec.js"
      ],
      "note": "复用已有确定性链路；这些文件通过不等于真实模型完成全部用户 case。"
    }
  ],
  "manual": [
    {
      "id": "release-cli-install",
      "stage": "cli",
      "document": "docs/testing-case-catalog.md",
      "description": "最终 tgz 独立 prefix 安装、首次配置、PTY、停止与继续、支持平台。"
    },
    {
      "id": "release-app-package",
      "stage": "app",
      "document": "docs/testing-execution-guide.md",
      "description": "最终 DMG 安装、Finder 启动、退出/重启、前版升级、签名/公证与干净用户。"
    },
    {
      "id": "release-app-native",
      "stage": "app",
      "document": "docs/testing-case-catalog.md",
      "description": "原生窗口、IPC、草稿、模型配置与协议的实际桌面体验。"
    },
    {
      "id": "release-applications",
      "stage": "applications",
      "document": "docs/testing-application-release.md",
      "description": "TXT/CAD/Blender/PPTist 固定素材、实际文件/工程、布局与体验。"
    },
    {
      "id": "release-computer-use",
      "stage": "applications",
      "document": "docs/testing-application-release.md",
      "description": "解锁 Mac 的系统权限、真实输入与保存、接管；宽松策略单列待实现。"
    },
    {
      "id": "release-live-cases",
      "stage": "cases",
      "document": "docs/testing-case-catalog.md",
      "description": "真实模型两端任务、费用、独立产物与人类交互；不会自动调用收费模型。"
    },
    {
      "id": "release-coverage-review",
      "stage": "basic",
      "document": "docs/testing-case-catalog.md",
      "description": "逐项核对全部规划的具体断言，文件映射仅为部分覆盖线索。"
    }
  ]
}
